Z||000000||maryjane||08-10-2001||01:42 AM||||If anyone is interested in this sort of thing, the yearly Perseid meteor shower is this weekend. Best night/time is Fri after midnight. Get out of town away from street lights, look toward the ENE. To the left of 7 sisters star cluster if you are familar with constellations. Best to take a reclining lawn chair and sweetheart(that way, night won't be totally wasted if you don't see many)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. edited to remove link that wouldn't work.  <p>[This message has been edited by maryjane (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||1
